# Prose collections are never formatted. Prettier's Markdown printer escapes
# underscores in text (W_\text{x} -> W\_\text{x}), which MathJax then renders
# literally, so any post with LaTeX is silently corrupted by `prettier --write`.
# Prettier has no option to disable that escaping, so ignoring is the only fix.
# Listing posts INDIVIDUALLY does not work: the CMS commits new posts straight
# through the GitHub API without prettier, so a new math post is never added
# here, `prettier --check` in CI then fails on it, and the reflex fix
# (`prettier --write`) is exactly what breaks the math. Ignore the whole tree.
_posts/**
_news/**
_sass/font-awesome/*.scss
_scripts/*
# Ignore citation YAML file generated by script
_data/citations.yml
# Jekyll front matter before the JSON, which Prettier cannot parse
site.webmanifest
# Liquid interleaved with inline HTML/JS/JSON, which Prettier's HTML printer splits and moves
_pages/cool-home.html
